<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/08c37bad596f> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[8963] The creator of the Kargu drone, STM, says the device 'can be effectively used against static or moving targets through its indigenous and real-time image processing capabilities and machine learning algorithms embedded on the platform.'" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8963" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/15573c1c20fd> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[8963] Turkey, a key combatant in the war, deployed the STM Kargu-2 drone, according to the UN Security Council's Panel of Experts on Libya report." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8963" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/173e13a9f15d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "A.I. Drone May Have Acted on Its Own in Attacking Fighters, U.N. Says" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1909" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/2215bf9b53fa> a airo:Evidence ;
